---
// src/pages/solutions/security.astro
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Security & DDoS Protection Solutions | InfraHub"
  description="Evaluate DDoS protection, FastNetMon detection and routing controls, application security, and BGP routing safeguards through InfraHub."
  canonicalPath="/solutions/security"
  ogImage="/images/og/solution.png"
  ogImageAlt="InfraHub solution family"
>
  <div class="section section-hero network-overlay">
    <div class="container hub-container">
      <div class="hub-header">
        <span class="hub-kicker">Solution family</span>
        <h1>Security & Network Defense</h1>
        <p class="hub-lead">
          Cloud scrubbing, out-of-band flow detection, automated FlowSpec mitigation, and external perimeter cybersecurity.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="services-grid">
        <div class="service-discovery-card">
          <span class="disc-pill">Cloud Mitigation</span>
          <h2>DDoS Cloud Scrubbing</h2>
          <p>Evaluate always-on or on-demand DDoS protection, including routing, onboarding, clean-traffic return, application requirements, and provider-specific service commitments.</p>
          <a href="/ddos-protection" class="disc-link">Explore DDoS Protection →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="service-discovery-card">
          <span class="disc-pill">Flow Telemetry</span>
          <h2>FastNetMon Advanced</h2>
          <p>Near-real-time automated attack detection analyzing sFlow, NetFlow, and IPFIX with automatic FlowSpec and RTBH triggers.</p>
          <a href="/partners/fastnetmon" class="disc-link">Explore FastNetMon →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="service-discovery-card">
          <span class="disc-pill">Routing Security</span>
          <h2>BGP & Routing Intelligence</h2>
          <p>Improve routing hygiene with RPKI origin validation, prefix and AS-path policy, monitoring, and incident-response procedures.</p>
          <a href="/lets-talk?service=bgp" class="disc-link">Inquire Routing Security →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="service-discovery-card">
          <span class="disc-pill">Perimeter</span>
          <h2>Cybersecurity & Pentesting</h2>
          <p>Evaluate vulnerability assessment, application protection, infrastructure hardening, and other specialist cybersecurity requirements where appropriate coverage is available.</p>
          <a href="/lets-talk?service=cybersecurity" class="disc-link">Inquire Security Sourcing →</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hub-cta">
        <h2>Harden Your Network Perimeter</h2>
        <a href="/lets-talk?service=security" class="btn btn-accent btn-lg">Discuss Security Requirements</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .hub-container { max-width: 1040px; }
  .hub-header { max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto 54px; }
  .hub-kicker { font-size: 0.74rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: var(--accent-blue); display: block; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .hub-header h1 { font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 4vw, 3.4rem); font-weight: 800; margin: 16px 0; }
  .hub-lead { font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.6; }
  .services-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 24px; margin-bottom: 64px; }
  @media (min-width: 640px) { .services-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }
  .service-discovery-card { background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 32px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm); display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; }
  .disc-pill { font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent-teal); letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .service-discovery-card h2 { font-size: 1.3rem; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .service-discovery-card p { font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.55; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .disc-link { font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--accent-blue); }
  .disc-link:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  .hub-cta { background-color: var(--bg-secondary); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: var(--radius-md); padding: 44px 36px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; text-align: left; gap: 16px; margin-top: 48px; }
</style>
